<title>SINGAPORE: Transpac 1996 net profit S$8.67 million.</title>
<headline>Transpac 1996 net profit S$8.67 million.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of S$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit				8.67 vs  0.36 (loss)</p>
<p>Dividend (cents)		     10.00 vs  nil</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)		    21.68 vs  0.91 (loss)</p>
<p>    Other income incl. interest	 4.63 vs  3.70</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit			  9.42 vs  0.07</p>
<p>    Tax					 0.75 vs  0.43</p>
<p>Note - Full name is Transpac Industrial Holdings Ltd.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703199)</p>
